# Deployment & Utilities

## CDN Management Tools

The project includes CDN localization tools for optimizing resource delivery:

### CDN Download Script
**[download_cdn_resources.py](mdc:download_cdn_resources.py)** - Downloads and localizes CDN resources
- Automatically downloads external CDN files (CSS, JS, fonts)
- Creates local copies in static directories
- Updates HTML templates to reference local files
- Supports multiple CDN providers (Bootstrap, jQuery, etc.)

### CDN Verification Script  
**[verify_cdn_resources.py](mdc:verify_cdn_resources.py)** - Verifies CDN resource integrity
- Checks if CDN resources are accessible
- Validates file integrity and sizes
- Reports missing or corrupted files
- Useful for deployment verification

### CDN Documentation
**[CDN本地化说明.md](mdc:CDN本地化说明.md)** - Comprehensive guide for CDN localization process
- Step-by-step instructions for running CDN tools
- Troubleshooting common issues
- Best practices for managing static resources

