## Deployment Checklist

### Pre-deployment Steps
1. Run **[verify_cdn_resources.py](mdc:verify_cdn_resources.py)** to check resource availability
2. Execute **[test_regions_api.py](mdc:test_regions_api.py)** to validate API functionality
3. Review security settings in **[mysite/settings.py](mdc:mysite/settings.py)**

### Production Configuration
- Move database credentials to environment variables
- Set `DEBUG = False`
- Configure `ALLOWED_HOSTS` appropriately
- Enable production security middleware
- Set up proper static file serving

### Post-deployment Validation
- Verify all API endpoints return expected responses
- Check static files load correctly
- Test authentication and session management
- Validate database connections and queries

